{
  "inShort": "The checkpoint is at risk: the shown artifacts do not establish a playable slice. The devlog claims tides and co-op, but its landscape image and film reference demonstrate neither. Both members joined and confirmed work, but Mia’s unstated hours leave capacity for the slice uncertain.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sa101am4gz8x0m11qfx",
      "text": "The public repository matches the task: Godot demos, an MIT license and import instructions. It supplies a technical starting point, not evidence of the game’s tide or sailing mechanics."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sd201an4gz82vgs6mq3",
      "text": "The animated reference video is marked done. Its title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, not gameplay from this project. The video was not watched, so its animation could not be assessed. A reference alone does not establish a chosen style."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sg701aq4gz890icklg1",
      "text": "The reference article matches the task and explains playtesting methods. It supports test preparation, but does not show that five players tested the slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35shi01ar4gz8cnvwlh43",
      "text": "The private design board is recorded as done. Its contents were not shown here, so its contribution to the slice cannot be assessed."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvu35smi01as4gz8qwek8deq"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [],
  "questions": [
    "What playable build demonstrates two islands, the tide loop and two-player sailing?",
    "What evidence records five players testing that build and what they found?",
    "How much time can Mia commit to the remaining slice?"
  ]
}

